{title: I Will Sing the Wondrous Story}
{artist: Francis Rowley & Peter Bilhorn}
{key: F}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: 88}

Verse 1
[F]I will sing the [Bb]wondrous [F]story of the [Bb]Christ who [F]died for [C]me —
[F]how he left his [Bb]home in [F]glory for the [C]cross of [F]Calvary.

Chorus
Yes, I'll [F]sing the [Bb]wondrous [F]story of the [Bb]Christ who [F]died for [C]me,
[F]sing it with the [Bb]saints in [F]glory, gathered [C]by the [F]crystal sea.
